---
// 404 Not Found page
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>ページが見つかりません | 中村達希</title>
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex">
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Helvetica Neue", "Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN", sans-serif;
      background-color: #FAF8F5;
      color: #1C1915;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 2rem;
      text-align: center;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    p {
      color: #556270;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }
    .back-btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.8rem 1.6rem;
      background-color: #1C1915;
      color: #FFFFFF;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }
    .back-btn:hover {
      background-color: #333333;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>404 Not Found</h1>
  <p>お探しのページは見つかりませんでした。<br>URLが変更されたか、削除された可能性があります。</p>
  <a href="/" class="back-btn">入口へ戻る</a>
</body>
</html>
